# Keys for scripts/notify-test-send.mts, the script that sends a few real test emails to your own inbox.
# Copy this file to .env.notify-test (same folder), paste each key after the equals sign, and save. .env.notify-test is ignored by git, so it
# never leaves your laptop. Fill in only the provider you are testing. Never paste a key into chat, and never put one in this example file.
BREVO_API_KEY=
MAILJET_API_KEY=
MAILJET_SECRET_KEY=
MAILTRAP_API_KEY=
